{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"a3a8a6af357c829d0f370ef4f2b117dc8787031a0f32501b5087da7fd8be5b5e","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"81a373c3924e301ce8b96d66ddc1d5f2f71205972df277c73018a3e95fbb8ded","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"81a89ef2587d746c59921c15963ba71971d1d21dd78456b62126fdfaa68cc66f","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"81bd75b225d0d289984f2c1ea88878d17428f91f4a688541f70cb474181e41c7","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"81cfd78fb2276b9c10256055331f3e0009c221619cc4d058b57b96a66da6ec53","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"81d715e4529c6c9b4f9b38ff0e5aca362bc7f1e5f8c64461923ddf741a870350","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"机制与跨条一致性：补查组件 mod-tome，公开源码 game/modules/tome/data/talents/techniques/pugilism.lua，固定 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，关键调用为该天赋 action 中的 self:getTalentLevel(t) >= 4 分支（约 359-375 行：达到该阈值时按 hit1/hit2/hit3 逐次 buildCombo，否则命中任一拳只 buildCombo 一次），证实阈值是「技能等级」而非角色等级。译文作「在等级 4 或更高时」，脱落「技能」限定；在本作中技能等级受系别精通与装备加成影响，与角色等级并不等价，读者会取错阈值。同一冻结集合第 6 条（dream-forge）把同型表述 At talent level 5 译为「技能等级 5 时」，两条用法不一致。"},{"revision_key":"81e47fad2a917254f4f5fcfbd26e96f6648f3143db09ba0560ca713577f97382","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"81efb1a50991947962566a8412997bacf0eb853feb498b3ab4b15f6b61180a6f","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"823379c255f8d7e888251f3602dc97c892bfa21ae769b5a1fe07bf4d9505cc33","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"语义与术语：其一，原文 seeking out precious metals and gemstones 指「贵金属」，译文作「重金属」（heavy metals），术语误译。其二，原文 some philosophers believe that dragons predate all other races, being formed as raw representations of the elements of nature at the beginning of the world，主张是「龙先于其他一切种族存在、是自然元素在世界之初的原初具现」；译文改写为「由于龙族在世界起源时形成较早，因此能表现出强大的元素亲和力」，删去 predate all other races 这一核心命题，并把原文并列的成因描述改造成虚构的因果推论。其三，同段内 Dragon-bone is highly favoured by staff-crafters for its natural attunement to elemental forces 的「元素亲和」被译成「魔法亲和力非常高」，而本条前文已自用「与埃亚尔某种元素的亲和」，条内术语自相矛盾；Dragonskin 的 oft retains some inkling of the original wyrm's power（残留原龙之力）同样被改写为「魔法亲和力」，源文并未限定为魔法。"},{"revision_key":"8236ae829a0518388ab64d690df1398383c28a9bb3e1796ab970518262e5f844","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8259a2d3f2f04fd328587b6f203303afadd60a9773e242d062ef9db1275c79f9","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"语义与术语：原文中 mirror copies of yourself ... your dreamselves ... one of your projections 指玩家自身的梦中分身（可被玩家控制），译文三处统一作「梦境守卫」（guardian），凭空引入不存在的守卫角色关系。补查组件 mod-tome，固定 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63：该条在 game/modules/tome/data/lore/misc.lua 中为 newLore{ id = \"dreamscape-entry\", category = \"dreamscape\", name = \"If I Should Die Before I Wake\" }；相关 zone 目录 game/modules/tome/data/zones/dreams/npcs.lua 仅定义 yeek illusion 与 lost wife，game/modules/tome/data/zones/dreamscape-talent/npcs.lua 无任何实体名，均无 guardian/守卫 对应物，「守卫」无来源支撑。另 With horror, you realize that you are not alone here 表达的是惊觉此处另有他者；译文「虽然恐惧，但你意识到自己并不孤单」改用转折句式并把语义转成正面的「不孤单」，与上下文的恐惧递进逻辑相反。"},{"revision_key":"825a59c67d3d4226141ae5765e7d528330e7d928fddea602829ef301bce94277","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8270daebe45840b8466f86771b6cf2575f9014b7d5507f9c26cb890024e238c7","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8286e8b2cae1627fa53646ecb3e5e12b098f6cc74516a04aaf191243c2bd53fe","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"语义：原文 with deep scores and scratches etched across its surface 是两类机械刻划（深凿痕与划痕），etched 在此形容刻划而非化学腐蚀；译文「上面有深深的划痕和腐蚀的痕迹」凭空加入原文没有的「腐蚀」，同时把 scores 与 scratches 合并，丢失「深凿痕」一项。补查组件 mod-tome，公开源码 game/modules/tome/data/lore/shertul.lua，固定 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，该条为 newLore{ id = \"shertul-fortress-9\", name = \"ninth mural painting\", image = \"shertul_fortress_lore9.png\" }，lore 正文即上引单句，前后无任何酸蚀或腐蚀来源可支持该添加。"},{"revision_key":"82a06a79168301bee956454ee13649334f65dd8f2fa3a2c12b40049c2d93e195","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"82aad516f0dc23fd2788d31d83836acdf4f12d795b8dbb3df96d84fc38e21940","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"语义与跨句关系：其一，原文先交代 they call themselves as a whole \"Elore\", which means \"siblings\"，随后 Shaloren (or Shalore - lit \"siblings of grace\") 与之直接呼应；译文作「（或不朽精灵——“不朽恩赐”）」，既丢掉 siblings 这一与上句的构词呼应，又把 grace（优雅/恩典）改成「不朽」，整条词源解释链条断裂。其二，more marked for their mental prowess than their physical strengths 是心智强于体魄的比较，译文「有着魔法运用上的巨大优势」把 mental prowess 混同为下一句才引出的 magical affinity，并丢失比较结构。其三，though they would soon have it forgotten 意为「他们巴不得此事被人遗忘」，译文「虽然他们可能已经忘记了它」主客体颠倒，且随后的 the memories of blame run deep amongst many（他人记恨甚深）因此失去承接。其四，experimenting in flesh preservation and necromancy 中 flesh preservation 为肉身保存/防腐，译文作「死者复生」，与并列的 necromancy（亡灵法术）重复且改变原意。其五，The Shaloren were the ones that began the Spellblaze 是明确归因，译文「是导致魔法大爆炸的源头之一」加入原文没有的「之一」削弱了该归因。"}]}